" ⌕│ Navigate                                                                 │t "
"┌ │   Ctrl-z         Suspend                                                 │─┐"
"│ │                  give the terminal back to the shell, as Ctrl-Z does in  │ │"
"│▸│                  any program — `fg` brings fastf back                    │ │"
"│ │   Tab            Next pane                                               │ │"
"│ │                  move focus: projects → detail → templates               │ │"
